        "problem": "$\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061z(7\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z+3\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z)\\,\\text{d}z=$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z)=-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061z\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z=-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z)=-{csch}^{2}\u2061z & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int {csch}^{2}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z=-\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061z(7\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z+3\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z)\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int (7\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z+3{csch}^{2}\u2061z)\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =7\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061z\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z+3\\int {csch}^{2}\u2061z\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =7(-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z)+3(-\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z)+C \\\\  & =-7\\operatorname{csch}\u2061z-3\\operatorname{coth}\u2061z+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
